{{GM|$Craft|$Clothes & Equipment|$Weapons|Stone $Arrow}}

A {{PAGENAME}} is ammunition for the [[Hunter's Bow]]. You can keep up to 30 arrows in a [[Hunter's Quiver]] by picking up the arrows and right clicking them onto the quiver, or opening the quiver inventory by right-clicking on the quiver.

''See also [[Bone Arrow]] and [[Metal Arrow]]''
==Notes==
* [[{{PAGENAME}}]] Quality = <math>\frac{_{q}Stone+ _{q}String+ _{q}Branch}{3}</math> and is [[softcap|softcapped]] by <math>\sqrt[2]{Dexterity*Survival}</math>.

* [[{{PAGENAME}}]] damage at any given quality is <math>10*\sqrt{Quality_{Arrow}/10}</math>

